# 14. Important Interview Questions

### What is the smallest deployable unit in Kubernetes?

Pod

---

### Does Kubernetes manage Containers?

No.

Kubernetes manages Pods.

---

### Who monitors Pods?

kubelet

---

### Who selects Worker Node?

Scheduler

---

### Who creates Container?

Container Runtime

---

### Who serves the application?

Container

---

### Who provides IP Address?

Pod

