# Hands-on Commands

Create Pod

```bash
kubectl apply -f my-nginx.yaml
```

View Pods

```bash
kubectl get pods
```

Describe Pod

```bash
kubectl describe pod my-nginx
```

Delete Pod

```bash
kubectl delete pod my-nginx
```

